84, 154.2049, 154.0479, 155.2851, 153.4327, 153.3416, 152.9308, 151.8454, 151.4532, 151.358, 151.6287, 151.4878, 150.016, 150.1981, 151.1839, 151.464, 152.0308, 151.0902, 148.3683, 148.9386, 145.7776, 143.8709, 144.312, 144.616, 145.1795, 143.9907, 144.585, 145.2759, 145.3859, 146.7992, 147.9281, 146.7177, 147.5465, 146.381, 147.7806, 148.701, 150.6725, 151.0221, 150.6014, 150.5715, 149.7872, 149.0463, 149.4724, 148.2591, 146.6056, 147.466, 146.6282, 146.9563, 145.7802, 145.6128, 145.8302, 147.156, 147.1288, 145.885, 146.6263, 145.3852, 144.6054, 143.5332, 144.3858, 144.0263, 144.7489, 144.4592, 143.6154, 143.4376, 143.7247, 143.2347, 144.2296, 142.7469, 142.1458, 142.1173, 141.291, 143.9911, 144.1098, 143.4163, 143.772, 144.187, 144.4012, 145.4224, 145.7167, 144.8817, 143.1875, 145.5491, 146.2167, 146.1163, 144.9832, 144.6333, 144.1996, 144.8384, 146.1282, 146.3473, 146.0199, 145.8866, 145.6728, 143.3353, 145.3055, 144.7003, 144.3267, 143.9041, 145.0165, 144.6626, 144.2698, 143.3549, 144.8983, 144.7329, 144.8103, 145.1105, 146.7865, 147.3938, 148.5287, 148.5367, 150.2613, 149.4584, 148.366, 146.6963, 147.2162, 146.7056, 147.7765, 147.9833, 151.1372, 151.0316, 151.3428, 151.6463, 152.2847, 150.1274, 149.1186, 148.241, 147.418, 145.1089, 145.4856, 146.3158, 146.4712, 145.8966, 145.9056, 146.263, 147.0092, 146.5228, 145.9873, 146.6039, 149.0617, 148.3275, 149.8427, 150.3318, 150.7842, 150.4701, 148.999, 148.2609, 148.3834, 149.325, 149.4817, 149.8556, 150.1755, 150.5781, 151.4311, 152.596, 152.9933, 153.1566, 152.0052, 150.9195, 152.1855, 154.037, 155.5486, 155.2328, 154.635, 155.4705, 155.9659, 156.6219, 157.1347, 157.4274, 155.492, 153.7018, 155.1876, 155.075, 156.7866, 157.9248, 158.3795, 158.6257, 159.0487, 159.0387, 159.43, 159.8833, 158.9704, 157.7005, 158.3326, 157.0228, 155.7881, 155.6605, 155.7396, 154.7389, 153.8229, 154.2318, 154.1284, 153.6991, 152.7276, 153.5815, 153.7627, 152.6871, 153.4721, 153.3958, 153.3868, 153.8364, 155.1514, 154.2338, 153.9094, 155.6362, 158.3544, 159.638, 160.1439, 160.592, 163.0749, 163.2034, 164.4419, 164.1782, 163.5978, 160.8488, 160.2374, 161.2085, 162.2573, 163.0318, 161.0955, 161.2772, 160.63, 159.3564, 159.8736, 159.8896, 160.2116, 160.5451, 160.9038, 160.2597, 160.6858, 160.5735, 161.1202, 162.4611, 161.4436, 161.6821, 161.3482, 162.0709, 161.8598, 161.5884, 162.038, 160.6539, 161.7438, 160.0287, 160.2092, 160.9426, 159.383, 160.7768, 161.4574, 162.0889, 161.0815, 161.1307], "summary_html": "<h1>从价值陷阱现象谈到 PB-ROE 框架 — 复现摘要</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>国盛《从价值陷阱现象谈到 PB-ROE 框架》的跨资产复现——原为 A 股\"低估值不等于便宜\"的 PB-ROE 联合估值框架，按因子逻辑迁移到商品期货截面。</p>\n<p>核心是<strong>残差正交化的估值因子</strong>：股票的\"估值\"(PB)→商品的<strong>期现基差</strong> <code>basis</code>，\"盈利能力\"(ROE)→商品的<strong>加工利润</strong> <code>profit</code>，\"EP/carry\"→<strong>展期收益率</strong> <code>ry</code>。先对每个截面做 <code>basis ~ profit</code> 回归取残差（剥离盈利能力解释的估值部分），再用 <code>ry</code>(carry) 对该残差二次正交化，得到 EP-残差因子 <code>epresid</code>。MAD 去极值 → 截面 rank → 连续化 → vol-target(0.15) → hold=5 调仓。</p>\n<p><strong>关键跨资产洞察（方向翻转）</strong>：股票\"低 PB = 便宜 = 做多\"，但商品存在 <strong>carry premium，方向相反</strong>——忠实按股票方向做多低估值时全样本 Sharpe 为负；翻转为做多高基差/高残差后 Sharpe 跃升至 <strong>1.11</strong>（年化 66%，MaxDD −23%）。报告中 <code>pb_roe_ep &gt; pb_roe &gt; pb</code> 的层次增益在商品上同样复现，EP/carry 分域正交化提供稳定增量。与因子库相关 0.39（非冗余），是进入实盘活跃集的差异化估值类因子。</p>\n<p>防前视：<code>basis</code> 用 <code>groupby(sym).shift(1)</code> 滞后一日。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>0.96</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>3.6%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>3.8%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-4.9%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.04</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2518</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.03</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>0.21</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.51 / 0.62</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2016</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.82</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.91</span></td><td>0.93</td><td>0.53</td><td>1.64</td><td>1.17</td><td>1.49</td><td>0.76</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.56</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.09</span></td><td>1.6</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>ry</code></td><td>展期收益</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>basis</code></td><td>基差</td><td>是</td></tr><tr><td><code>profit</code></td><td>利润</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>47</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2520</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>98.7%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>41.4</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>实盘变体 <code>epresid_hd5_raw</code> 的核心公式（与 strategy_final.py 一致，hold=5）。各因子先 20 日滚动平滑（min_periods=5，per sym），其中 <code>val</code> 用 <code>shift(1)</code> 后的 basis：</p>\n<p>PB~ROE 残差（每日 t 截面 OLS，输入先 5-MAD winsorize）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{resid\\_pr}_t^i = \\text{val\\_w}_t^i - (a_t + b_t\\cdot\\text{prof\\_w}_t^i)</div>\n<p>EP（carry）分域增强（第二段截面 OLS）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{resid\\_ep}_t^i = \\text{resid\\_pr}_t^i - (c_t + d_t\\cdot\\text{ry\\_s}_t^i)</div>\n<p>仓位（做多高残差，与股票方向相反，sign=+1）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{rk}_t^i = \\text{rank}^{cs}_t(\\text{resid\\_ep}_t^i),\\qquad \\text{dir}_t^i = 2\\cdot\\text{rk}_t^i - 1</div>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-display\">\\text{pos}_t^i = \\text{rebalance\\_hold}\\big(\\text{vol\\_target\\_scale}(\\text{dir},\\,\\sigma_{target}=0.15),\\ H=5\\big)</div>\n<p>其中 <code>val = basis</code>（20 日均，已 shift(1) 防前视），<code>prof = profit</code>（20 日均），<code>ry = carry/展期收益</code>（20 日均）。<code>basis</code> 字段隐含 1 天前视，使用前 shift(1)（见 PITFALLS / audit）。</p>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>轮</th><th>诊断</th><th>行动</th><th>效果</th></tr><tr><td>R1</td><td>全变体 Sharpe 负（−0.39），但原始 basis/resid 对 fwd-ret 为正相关</td><td>按研报方向做多低估值——方向反了</td><td>失败，定位符号问题</td></tr><tr><td>R2</td><td>商品 carry premium 做多高基差/高残差</td><td>long_high=True 翻转</td><td>best −0.39→+1.11，gate 通过</td></tr><tr><td>R3</td><td>验证稳健性</td><td>smooth×hold×vt 网格（37 变体）</td><td>全网格 1.0–1.1，无过拟合，3 轮通过→skip</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li>数据：日频 kline_daynight_all.parquet，需 basis/profit/ry，48 品种有完整三字段（中位截面 45）。</li>\n<li>频率/持仓：日频信号，10 日再平衡，多空截面中性。</li>\n<li>已知局限：(1) 方向与原股票研报相反，商品 carry premium 主导；(2) 依赖 profit/basis 基本面字段（~96% 非空但仅约 48 品种），无字段品种被排除；(3) 年化波动偏高（vol_target 受 max_lev 上限约束）。</li>\n<li>核心价值：EP（carry）分域增强相对纯 PB-ROE 残差有稳定增量（1.11 vs 1.02），与研报\"PE 分域大幅提升拟合优度\"结论一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>LONG_HIGH</code></td><td><code>True</code></td><td>商品 carry premium: 高残差 → long</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 1.56s</li>\n</ul>"}